{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p000248","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p000248"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p000248","label":"鄭厲公","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"厲公","mention_ids":["c-shiji-004-zhou:m051-0033"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m051-0033","chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p051","quote":"厲公"}],"identity_note":"依本卷特定時代與敘事建立；同名與世襲官號不得全庫合併，本名未見不補造。","review":"ai_provisional"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m051-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"厲公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000248","status":"source_identified","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p051","chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p051","text":"十三年，鄭伐滑，王使游孫、伯服請滑，鄭人囚之。鄭文公怨惠王之入不與厲公爵，又怨襄王之與衛滑，故囚伯服。王怒，將以翟伐鄭。富辰諫曰：「凡我周之東徙，晉、鄭焉依。子穨之亂，又鄭之由定，今以小怨棄之！」王不聽。十五年，王降翟師以伐鄭。王德翟人，將以其女為后。富辰諫曰：「平、桓、莊、惠皆受鄭勞，王棄親親翟，不可從。」王不聽。十六年，王絀翟后，翟人來誅，殺譚伯。富辰曰：「吾數諫不從。如是不出，王以我為懟乎？」乃以其屬死之。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m051-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"游孫","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000245","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m051-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"伯服","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000246","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m051-0023","start":23,"end":26,"surface":"鄭文公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000247","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m051-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000236","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m051-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"厲公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000248","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m051-0039","st